   180	```
   181	echo "tessera <root|release> ceremony $(date -u +%FT%TZ)" > ~/proof.txt
   182	gpg --local-user "$FPR" --digest-algo SHA256 --armor --detach-sign ~/proof.txt && gpg --verify ~/proof.txt.asc ~/proof.txt
   183	```
   184	2. No touch: run the signing command again (output `~/nt.asc`), enter the PIN, **do not touch**. It must fail
   185	   (timeout) and produce no signature.
   186	3. Fresh PIN: sign once more (`~/p2.asc`). It must ask for the PIN again. Note whether it did.
   187	4. `gpg --card-status`: record the signature counter (1 per successful signature).
